<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Scottish league and</p>
<p>cup soccer matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>F.A. Cup fourth round replay</p>
<p> Dundee	  0  Greenock Morton	1 after extra time</p>
<p>(Greenock at home to Kilmarnock in quarter-finals)</p>
<p>Premier division</p>
<p> Raith	   1  Motherwell	     5</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Arbroath	1  Albion		   2</p>
</text>
